      "description": {
        "fun": "The scarlet, feathered lizard on the box of Pokémon Scarlet, and your ride across Paldea: it runs on all fours like a motorbike, paddles across water and glides on its unfurled head tendrils. An old expedition journal calls it the Winged King. Its name may be meant to sound like 'go ride on', and Honda has a project to recreate it as a real, moving model.",
        "guide": "A Fighting and Dragon-type Legendary Paradox Pokémon and the mascot of Pokémon Scarlet, said to be either an ancestor of Cyclizar or a version of it from a parallel timeline. It changes shape to sprint, swim and glide, and battles in its Apex Build. Its futuristic counterpart is Miraidon.",
